{"product_id":"uwell-caliburn-az3-pod-kit","title":"Uwell Caliburn AZ3 Pod Kit","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Uwell Caliburn AZ3 vape kit is a pocket-friendly pod that’s ideal for on-the-go vaping and is designed with ease of use in mind. It’s powered by a built-in 750mAh battery and delivers up to 17W of power. The AZ3 is an ideal option for beginners or more experienced vapers who are simply looking for a discreet vape. Each kit comes complete with two refillable Caliburn A3 pods to help you get started.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFeatures:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCompact Refillable Pod Kit\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e750mAh Battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUSB-C Fast Charging\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eInhale Activated\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMTL Vaping\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2ml Refillable Pods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBuilt-In Mesh Coils\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThanks to inhale activation, there’s no need to deal with any buttons or menus, instead, you can just puff on the mouthpiece. Your device will then create a small amount of vapour for an MTL (Mouth To Lung) vape that feels like a cigarette. The built-in chipset recognises which pod you’ve selected and will automatically adjust the wattage, this means no guesswork and the perfect power level every time.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Caliburn A3 pods can each hold up to 2ml of your favourite e-liquid and refilling them is very easy – take off the mouthpiece to reveal the filling port, you don’t even have to remove the pod from your kit. The built-in mesh coils will heat up your e-liquid faster for improved flavour and you won’t need to worry about messy coil changes either, as you can just replace the entire pod instead. We suggest pairing the pods with 50\/50 e-liquid or higher PG options.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePlease note: The Uwell Caliburn AZ3 kit does not include a USB-C charging cable, but you can buy a USB-C Cable separately.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eContains:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUwell Caliburn AZ3 Device\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003ca title=\"Uwell Caliburn A3 Replacement Pods\" href=\"https:\/\/www.[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/uwell-caliburn-a3-replacement-pods\"\u003e0.8 Ohm Caliburn A3 Refillable Pod\u003c\/a\u003e (Pre-Installed)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1.0 Ohm Caliburn A3 Refillable Pod (Spare)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUser Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Uwell","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41875299565623,"sku":"U Cali AZ3 Pod Kit","price":4550.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/caliburn-az3-kit-min.jpg?v=1757721409","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/uwell-caliburn-az3-pod-kit","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




